      "title": {
        "en": "Dwa, dwie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "With a masculine thing (not a man) or a neuter noun two is *dwa*: *dwa banany*, *dwa piwa*. With a feminine noun it is *dwie*: *dwie papryki*, *dwie cebule*. After *dwa*, *trzy*, *cztery* the noun is plural: *trzy gruszki*, *cztery pomidory*."
      }
    }
